# Generated thesis figures and metric dumps. The script that produces them
# (plot_training_curves.py) and the written notes (chapter4-5-fill-in.md,
# model_metrics_report_19class.md) stay tracked — only their output is ignored.
docs/thesis-figures/*.png
docs/thesis-figures/*.svg
docs/thesis-figures/*.json
